  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of stereo isomers possible for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>ox</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>Br</mi></mfenced><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> is&nbsp;__________.</p><p>[<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ox</mi><mo>=</mo></math> oxalate]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Total number of stereoisomers in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>ox</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>Br</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></mrow></msup></math> i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8771;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>AA</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>ab</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8dece022-7a1e-44ab-9b22-618fcc5b1836-image.png\" style=\"width: 288px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> cis is optically active isomers and trans is optically inactive isomer</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Hence total isomers is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
